# Absolute imports

Use the `#/*` project import alias instead of relative imports for files inside `apps/web/src`.

```typescript
// Bad
import { LogoLink } from "../components/logo-link"
import { mdxComponentShowcases } from "./mdx-component-showcases"

// Good
import { LogoLink } from "#/components/logo-link"
import { mdxComponentShowcases } from "#/mdx-component-showcases"
```

Keep package imports unchanged, and only use relative imports when importing files outside the `#/*` alias scope.
